    "F exactlySIG_TIME_X3/CENTER_25K/CENTER_UNITS; no CROSS_RX/RDrop. Original default cosine6x160/scale30 joint, NoExplicitCFO.",
    "B0 CEordinary1; C0 .5ordinary+.5raw; B1 .5ordinary+.5fullAs; M B1+.5*6*mean128(teacherCorrect*KL(nontrue_teacher||nontrue_student/6)). CEtemp1/.01 for every L. No auxiliary gradient to true student logit.",
